    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The project includes the building of a new pasta line with a capacity of 2100 kg/hour. The company bought the machinery from an Italian firm for SAR 9.75 million. The line is the fourth within Wafrah&#39;s pasta factory.</p>\r\n",
